  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "platform-review",
      "title": "Platform and revision review",
      "text": "MinION and Flongle are recorded separately. The supplied rapid barcoding documents have different revisions (MinION R and Flongle S). The alternate ligation DNA export is headed MinION despite FLONGLE in its filename. Choose the exact platform and revision before an experiment; catalog association is not a compatibility approval."
    },
    {
      "id": "source-deduplication",
      "title": "Source copies and duplicates",
      "text": "The 14 supplied filenames represent 13 distinct PDF byte streams. The two poly(A) requirement files have the same SHA-256 and share one reference record with both filename aliases. The two MinION DNA ligation exports have different byte streams and remain separate source records."
    },
    {
      "id": "rna-reference-review",
      "title": "RNA reference scope",
      "text": "The direct RNA protocol is SQK-RNA004. The poly(A) requirements note names SQK-RNA002, SQK-PCS111 and SQK-PCB111.24; it is linked as older-kit background, not as validated RNA004 guidance. Verify applicability before use."
    }
  ]
